escription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-02-07T23:39:05Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T23:45:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nMacBookPro 2018(Intel) / iPhone16 with iOS 18.1 on simulator\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf the imported image is larger than a certain resolution, CompressedTexture2D will not be rendered correctly and will be black. This seems to occur only when the compression mode is RGB8 and not when RGBA8.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b706f6e-18be-4870-91d5-f35aa98fa494)\n\nHowever, when tested on the real device(iPhoneSE2 with iOS18.3), it was drawn correctly.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a07cb50-f111-484f-8609-effcfa6fc978)\n\nPossibly it is a problem with the combination of IntelMac and the simulator🤔, but I would like to know if there are any cases where a similar problem occurs.\n\nIt's a hack, but there is a workaround by placing 1px a=0.99 on all images in one of the four corners of the image. However, a method like https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2107 would be more preferable.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen web page of the exported html with RGB8 CompressedTexture2D scene on iOS simulator on XCode\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[texture_2d_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18715453/texture_2d_test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102564/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102564/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}